    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_hewn_round_timber): Hop poles, hoop/telegraph poles and piling are round timber; classifier matched 'hop' (the brewing crop) or left the heading in residuals. Layer-1 observations: 61 rows, 1875–1891. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×15; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×46. Units: (no unit) ×56; Cords ×3; Pieces ×2. Top routes: Quebec → United States ×17; Quebec → All Countries ×16; Quebec → Great Britain ×7; Ontario → United States ×2."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <id/scheme/#resource> ;
    skos:notation "0585" ;
